{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22191","headline":"舟行 · 白居易","name":"舟行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帆影日渐高，闲眠犹未起。\n起问鼓枻人，已行三十里。\n船头有行竈，炊稻烹红鲤。\n饱食起婆娑，盥漱秋江水。\n平生沧浪意，一旦来游此。\n何况不失家，舟中载妻子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}